<title>USA: Times Mirror August ad revs up 2.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Times Mirror August ad revs up 2.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Times Mirror Co said advertising revenues for its newspaper publishing group rose 2.6 percent for the four weeks ended September 1 to $117.2 million from $114.2 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>For the 35-week year-to-date period, total advertising revenues were up 1.1 percent to $1.02 billion. The company said 1996 year to date results contained six more days than in the year-ago period.</p>
